// RULING-1: 🟢 pretty-much-done — self-hosted fleet substrate (operator 2026-05-28: srv1/srv2 Ampere Altra / Arm64).
// Consumed by YamlStatic workflow projection.
// Fleet arch is a closed operator fact as `arch: Symbol` (not a sum type — avoids Lens-CI coproduct resolution).
// 🟡 gated — feature:formatter-int-refinement — bind T-25-core — dissolve-on-arrival: replace annotated Int fields with Refined<Int> via T-25-core refine substrate; each field's ≥1 annotation becomes the validation predicate; forbidden: UInt/Nat for config literals (Peano representation makes integer data nodes impractical).
