// 🟡 gated — live-workflow projection interim (docs/modeling-discipline.md Practice 2/10) — feature:project-github-actions-landed — consumer:CiLiveWorkflowStepSignal strict env projection — bind ROADMAP.md T-PB-B + src/v4/test/claim/workflow/ci_component_affected.dag — dissolve-on-arrival: emitted/projected GitHub Actions workflow reads typed step env from `ci_pipeline`/command policy rows and this bridge carrier is deleted; forbidden: encoding absent env bindings as empty strings.
