// 🟡 gated — live-workflow projection interim (docs/r3-program-plan.md gates #98/#100; docs/modeling-discipline.md Practice 10) — feature:project-github-actions-landed — consumer:v4.workflow.ci m1_ci_live_workflow_signal — bind ROADMAP.md T-PB-B + src/v4/test/claim/workflow/runner_pool_m1_probe.dag — dissolve-on-arrival: emitted/projected GitHub Actions workflow reads `ci_pipeline`/`M1RustEmitProbeCommand` directly and `m1_ci_live_workflow_signal` is deleted; forbidden: adding M1 probe step facts outside `ci_pipeline` + this binding.
